# Secrets that must never reach GitHub. Every other secret in this project
# (web_reader's DB password, the sync/deploy-webhook tokens, ...) is
# provisioned straight onto the target Pi by a setup/ script instead of
# living in the repo at all — see rpi5/setup/setup_weathermap.sh and its
# sibling setup_sync_trigger.sh/setup_deploy_webhook.sh. This file is meant
# as a backstop for a key dropped locally ahead of that setup step, not a
# sanctioned second place for secrets to live.
rpi5/apikey/
